VALUES (NULL, NULL, 5126, 'Rogue Trooper', 'Rogue Trooper', 'game', 2006, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7npa.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar21on.jpg', 'Intense 3rd-person action on the battlefields of Nu Earth - a poisoned planet where a seemingly endless war rages between the Norts and the Southers. A futile struggle on a hostile planet with no clear end in sight!

But there are tales of a lone warrior. A man who can appear out of thin air and take out whole platoons, then disappear back into the shadows to which he belongs. A man who knows no allegiance but to his own mission and is hell-bent on revenge. He is the ultimate soldier, the last survivor of the massacred Genetic Infantrymen...

...the Rogue Trooper!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/rogue-trooper', '["Xbox", "Wii", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 2"]', NULL, 7.7, 0, 8.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
