VALUES (NULL, NULL, 185252, 'Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine II', 'Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine II', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vab.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar3qn7.jpg', 'The galaxy is in peril. Entire worlds are falling. The Imperium needs you. Embody the superhuman skill and brutality of a Space Marine, the greatest of the Emperor''s warriors, with Clive Standen (Vikings, Taken) as the iconic Captain Titus. Unleash deadly abilities and an arsenal of devastating weaponry to obliterate the relentless Tyranid hordes. Hold at bay the horrors of the galaxy in epic battles on far-flung planets. Uncover dark secrets and drive back the everlasting night to prove your ultimate loyalty to humanity.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/warhammer-40000-space-marine-ii', '["Xbox Series X|S", "Nintendo Switch 2", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 7.9, 0, 5.69666666666666632e+00, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
