VALUES (NULL, NULL, 7485, 'The Witch and the Hundred Knight', 'The Witch and the Hundred Knight', 'game', 2013, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rod.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/g63foraie7ky1cpzwrho.jpg', 'Two powerful witches have been battling one another for over a hundred years. Now, the Swamp Witch has unleashed the legendary Dark Knights, and seeks to destroy the Forest Witch once and for all!

Adopting high-res, fully 3D environments and characters, as well as a dark fantasy world brought to life by Takehito Harada, The Witch and the Hundred Knights will deliver a brand-new action RPG experience from Nippon Ichi Software.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/the-witch-and-the-hundred-knight', '["PlayStation 3"]', NULL, 7.1, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
