VALUES (NULL, NULL, 475, 'Star Wars: The Force Unleashed', 'Star Wars: The Force Unleashed', 'game', 2008, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25xx.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar5rl6.jpg', 'Star Wars: The Force Unleashed is a Star Wars video game that takes place between the films Star Wars: Episode III Revenge of the Sith and Star Wars: Episode IV A New Hope. It is the centerpiece of the Star Wars: The Force Unleashed multimedia project,

Star Wars: The Force Unleashed completely re-imagines the scope and scale of the Force and casts players as Darth Vader’s "Secret Apprentice," unveiling new revelations about the Star Wars galaxy seen through the eyes of a mysterious new character armed with unprecedented powers.

The game showcases Digital Molecular Matter (DMM), an extremely detailed and realistic material physics engine developed by Pixelux, and Euphoria, a realistic bio-mechanical A.I. engine by NaturalMotion', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/star-wars-the-force-unleashed', '["N-Gage", "PlayStation 3", "iOS", "Xbox 360", "Legacy Mobile Device"]', NULL, 6.8, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
