VALUES (NULL, NULL, 16300, 'Dragon''s Dogma: Dark Arisen', 'Dragon''s Dogma: Dark Arisen', 'game', 2013, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a1v.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/x7fsekx7evfibw7bgmpq.jpg', 'An open-world action role-playing game set in the high-fantasy land of Gransys. Players create a customizable protagonist and explore the world in real-time combat, choosing among vocations such as fighter, mage, and strider. A defining feature is the Pawn system, AI companions who fight alongside the player, offer advice, and can be shared with other players online. Combat lets characters grapple and climb large monsters to reach vulnerable spots. Dark Arisen is an expanded edition of the original Dragon''s Dogma that adds the Bitterblack Isle area with new high-level enemies, quests, and equipment.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dragons-dogma-dark-arisen', '["PlayStation 3", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 7.9, 0, 9.02, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
