VALUES (NULL, NULL, 115060, 'Dragon''s Dogma II', 'Dragon''s Dogma II', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co833w.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar67fb.jpg', 'Dragon''s Dogma is a single player, narrative driven action-RPG that challenges players to choose their own experience – from the appearance of their Arisen, their vocation, their party, how to approach different situations and more.

On your journey, you’ll be joined by Pawns, mysterious otherworldly beings, in an adventure so unique you will feel as if accompanied by other players while on your own adventure.

All of these elements are elevated further by the latest in graphics, artificial intelligence (AI) and physics technology to create a truly immersive fantasy world in Dragon''s Dogma 2.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dragons-dogma-ii', '["Xbox Series X|S", "Nintendo Switch 2", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 8.2, 0, 6.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
