Use sunlight, wind and water to create an energy system and automate your processes like gathering ressoureces, watering your plants or catching fish.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/solarpunk', '["Xbox Series X|S", "Nintendo Switch 2", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 8.05, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
