VALUES (NULL, NULL, 1318, 'XCOM: Enemy Unknown', 'XCOM: Enemy Unknown', 'game', 2012, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29i2.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/lban07qq23rrgnvv82jv.jpg', 'XCOM: Enemy Unknown is a turn-based tactics game with a strategic management layer, and a reimagining of the 1994 strategy title UFO: Enemy Unknown. Players lead a squad of soldiers through turn-based combat missions against alien forces, using cover, positioning, and class-based abilities, where fallen soldiers can be lost permanently. Between missions, players oversee a central base: researching recovered alien technology, building facilities, managing funds, and deciding which global threats to respond to as they try to keep member nations from abandoning the project.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/xcom-enemy-unknown', '["PlayStation 3", "Linux", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "Mac", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.6, 0, 1.08, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
