VALUES (NULL, NULL, 257835, 'Indigo Park', 'Indigo Park', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88ki.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2g7x.jpg', 'Indigo Park is an immersive first-person exploration game that takes you on a thrilling journey through the eerie remnants of an abandoned amusement park. As the protagonist, you will step into the shoes of an adventurous soul eager to uncover the mysteries hidden within this once vibrant and lively attraction.

Official description (from Steam): Explore the abandoned childhood wonder of Indigo Park! Guided by Rambley the Raccoon, help restore power to the destroyed amusement park while you run from the reason it shut down.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/indigo-park', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 8.7, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
