PS2/PSP exclusive version of the video game.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/toy-story-3--2', '["PlayStation Portable", "PlayStation 2"]', NULL, 7.9, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
