VALUES (NULL, NULL, 740, 'Halo: Combat Evolved', 'Halo: Combat Evolved', 'game', 2001, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r2r.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar5jvc.jpg', 'Bent on Humankind''s extermination, a powerful fellowship of alien races known as the Covenant is wiping out Earth''s fledgling interstellar empire. Climb into the boots of Master Chief, a biologically altered super-soldier, as you and the other surviving defenders of a devastated colony-world make a desperate attempt to lure the alien fleet away from earth. Shot down and marooned on the ancient ring-world Halo, you begin a guerilla-war against the Covenant. Fight for humanity against an alien onslaught as you race to uncover the mysteries of Halo.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/halo-combat-evolved', '["Xbox", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.5, 0, 1.16, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
