VALUES (NULL, NULL, 2002, 'Banished', 'Banished', 'game', 2014, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1li9.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar1z38.jpg', 'Welcome to the world of Banished! In this city-building strategy game, you control a group of exiled travelers who decide to restart their lives in a new land. They have only the clothes on their backs and a cart filled with supplies from their homeland.

The objective of the game is to keep the population alive and grow it into a successful culture. Options for feeding the people include hunting and gathering, agriculture, trade, and fishing. However, sustainable practices must be considered to survive in the long term.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/banished', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
