Become a dressmaker, choose dress designs, cut out fabric and sew them all together to satisfy (or sabotage!) customers.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dressmaker--1', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 8.4, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
