VALUES (NULL, NULL, 164867, 'Dredge', 'Dredge', 'game', 2023, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kyk.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar4dxp.jpg', 'Dredge is a fishing adventure with a sinister undercurrent. Sell your catch, upgrade your vessel and dredge the depths for long-buried relics. Explore the stories of the strange locals and discover why some things are best left forgotten.
Captain your fishing trawler across a collection of remote islands, each with its own inhabitants to meet, wildlife to discover, and stories to unearth.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dredge', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "PlayStation 5", "Mac", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 8.3, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
