Step into a world of dark fantasy and revel in the exhilarating, action-packed battles!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/stranger-of-paradise-final-fantasy-origin', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.3, 0, 1.03, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
