Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr is a grim Action-RPG featuring multiple classes of the Inquisition who will carry out the Emperor'' will in the darkest reaches of the Imperium!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/warhammer-40000-inquisitor-martyr', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 6.1, 0, 1.06, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
