VALUES (NULL, NULL, 18320, 'Battlefield 1', 'Battlefield 1', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n9d.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar6gwl.jpg', 'Discover classic Battlefield gameplay with epic multiplayer and an adventure-filled campaign. Experience the dawn of all-out war, only in Battlefield 1. Fight your way through epic battles going from tight urban combat in a besieged French city to big open spaces in the Italian Alps or frantic combats in the Arabic sand dunes. Experience large-scale battles as infantry or piloting vehicles on land, air and sea, from the tanks and bikes on the ground, to bi-planes and gigantic battleships.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/battlefield-1', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 8.3, 0, 1.08, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
