VALUES (NULL, NULL, 134070, 'Mafia: Definitive Edition', 'Mafia: Definitive Edition', 'game', 2020, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26vl.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar729.jpg', 'Re-made from the ground up, rise through the ranks of the Mafia during the Prohibition era of organized crime. After a run-in with the mob, cab driver Tommy Angelo is thrust into a deadly underworld. Initially uneasy about falling in with the Salieri crime family, Tommy soon finds that the rewards are too big to ignore.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/mafia-definitive-edition', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.7, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
