VALUES (NULL, NULL, 127044, 'Marvel''s Spider-Man 2', 'Marvel''s Spider-Man 2', 'game', 2023, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cobg1k.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2d8r.jpg', 'Marvel''s Spider-Man 2 is an action-adventure game developed by Insomniac Games and published by Sony Interactive Entertainment. Released in October 2023 exclusively for the PlayStation 5, it is a direct sequel to Marvel''s Spider-Man (2018) and Marvel''s Spider-Man: Miles Morales (2020). The game continues the story of Peter Parker and Miles Morales as they face new challenges and threats in New York City.

In Marvel''s Spider-Man 2, players can switch between Peter and Miles, each with unique abilities and combat styles. The game introduces new villains, including Kraven the Hunter and Venom, while expanding the open-world environment with more detailed and interactive elements.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/marvels-spider-man-2', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 8.3, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
