VALUES (NULL, NULL, 226242, 'B-17 Flying Fortress: The Mighty 8th Redux', 'B-17 Flying Fortress: The Mighty 8th Redux', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82pq.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar1zcv.jpg', 'The classic game remastered. Feel the power of flying a 10-men crew on a B-17 over occupied Europe in WWII. Plan the mission, choose your men and take action in every post onboard, from pilot to bombardier and machine gunners. Get ready for a high-flying adventure in this all-time classic remake.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/b-17-flying-fortress-the-mighty-8th-redux', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
