Recruiting, training and guiding the right crew, and keeping them alive, is vital in turning the tides of war and achieving success on your bombing campaign.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/bomber-crew', '["PlayStation 4", "Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 8.0, 0, 1.09, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
