VALUES (NULL, NULL, 119234, 'Zombie Army 4: Dead War', 'Zombie Army 4: Dead War', 'game', 2020, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lwq.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar8d0.jpg', 'Hitler''s hordes are back for more in this spine-chilling shooter from the makers of Sniper Elite 4! Abominable occult enemies, epic weapons and a harrowing new campaign for 1-4 players await in 1940''s Europe, as you fight to save humankind from undead armageddon.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/zombie-army-4-dead-war', '["Google Stadia", "Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 6.9, 0, 1.11, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
