VALUES (NULL, NULL, 342, 'Duke Nukem 3D', 'Duke Nukem 3D', 'game', 1996, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y7x.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sctf9v.jpg', 'Duke Nukem 3D is a first-person shooter in which players move through levels from the protagonist''s viewpoint, fighting aliens and mutated foes with a varied arsenal. Its environments are highly interactive and destructible, and levels are designed in a non-linear way, letting players use air ducts, back routes, and hidden areas to explore or avoid enemies. Set across recognizable real-world style locations, the game is known for its satirical humor and references to action films and pop culture.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/duke-nukem-3d', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "DOS"]', NULL, 7.9, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-19 20:56:22')
